            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Synklok 1.0.3 for Windows</h3>
<ul>
  <li><b>First Windows release.</b> A system-tray app for Windows 10 and 11 that keeps the M-1620 Pro D's sample rate matched to its MADI input, like the Mac version.</li>
  <li><b>Automatic updates.</b> Synklok checks synklok.app once a day and asks before installing. Use <i>Check for updates…</i> in the tray menu, or turn automatic checks off in Settings.</li>
  <li>Installs for your Windows account only; no administrator password needed.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
